@startuml architecture
!theme vibrant
title Interview-Preparation Application Architecture

package "Frontend" {
  [UI JavaScript]
}

package "Backend (FastAPI)" {
  [Router] as Router
  [Manager] as Manager

  package "Engines & Logic" {
    [Logic]
    [PlanParser]
    [QuizEngine]
    [TrainingEngine]
    [WriterAgent]
  }
}

cloud "External Services" {
    [OpenAI API] as OpenAI
    [Google Calendar]
}

' === Relationships ===
[UI JavaScript] -down-> Router : HTTP API Calls

Router ..> Manager : Uses Dependency Injection

Manager --> Logic : Calculates Stats
Manager --> PlanParser : Parses Markdown Plan
Manager --> WriterAgent : Generates Plan
Manager --> QuizEngine : Generates Quiz
Manager --> TrainingEngine : Generates Training
Manager --> [Google Calendar] : Syncs tasks

WriterAgent ..> OpenAI : Generates text
QuizEngine ..> OpenAI : Generates questions
TrainingEngine ..> OpenAI : Generates explanations
@enduml